## Quick-start recipes

### 1. Structure a project

> Help me structure `<project>`. Propose: bounded contexts, decision criteria,
> key alternatives, hand-offs, missing evidence.

### 2. Build a disciplined vocabulary

> Produce a UTS for `<domain>`: 10+ rows, Tech vs Plain names, SenseCells.

### 3. Organise a mixed human/AI team

> Propose a bounded-context map: contexts, vocabularies, roles, bridges.

### 4. Harvest SoTA

> Using G.2 and G.4, extract TraditionCards, OperatorCards, SoTA Pack.

